 "pages": {
  "default/31546.htm": {
   "file": "default/31546.htm",
   "quest": null,
   "text": "Kuber: Clean air, beautiful views! Not to mention the delicious cuisine of chefs Jeffrey and Donath! I could live here forever! In fact, I think I will!",
   "header": "Kuber",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Ask about the efficacy of hot springs",
     "bypass": "npc_%objectId%_Chat 1",
     "kind": "page",
     "to": "default/31546-1.htm"
    },
    {
     "text": "Quest",
     "bypass": "npc_%objectId%_Quest",
     "kind": "quest-menu",
     "to": "@questlist"
    }
   ]
  },
  "default/31546-1.htm": {
   "file": "default/31546-1.htm",
   "quest": null,
   "text": "Kuber: These hot springs are known to heal many conditions. The red hot spring is good for cholera and malaria, the yellow one for rheumatism and malaria, and the green one for influenza and malaria. If you're tired, why don't you take a bath?",
   "header": "Kuber",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Return",
     "bypass": "npc_%objectId%_Chat 0",
     "kind": "page",
     "to": "default/31546.htm"
    }
   ]
  },
